			"text": "#### Visualize",
			"x": -2581,
			"y": 2340,
			"width": 132,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "grp-lanes",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Tier 1 staging → master   ·   one lane per device, per participant × season",
			"x": -20,
			"y": -20,
			"width": 1060,
			"height": 1120
		},
		{
			"id": "lane-act",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Actigraph  ·  wrist accelerometer (GENEActiv, 100 Hz)",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 1010,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "g-s1",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "step 1 · epoching",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 60,
			"width": 370,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a-bin",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Raw acceleration**\n`.bin` — 3 axes at 100 Hz\n\n*a thousand samples a second, per axis*",
			"x": 35,
			"y": 90,
			"width": 150,
			"height": 100
		},
		{
			"id": "a-epoch",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Epoch summary — 60 s**\n$SVM=\\sum_t\\,\\bigl|\\;\\|a_t\\|-1\\;\\bigr|$\n\ngravity removed by subtracting 1 g; also mean + SD per axis\n*→ `_60s.csv`*",
			"x": 205,
			"y": 90,
			"width": 170,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "g-s2",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "step 2 · rest–activity measures",
			"x": 410,
			"y": 60,
			"width": 350,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a-metrics",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**What the rhythm looks like**\n**M10 / L5** — mean activity of the most / least active 10 h / 5 h window (noon-to-noon): *when* it falls + *how high*\n**IS** — day-to-day repeatability of the 24 h profile (0–1)\n**IV** — hour-to-hour fragmentation\n**RA** = (M10−L5)/(M10+L5) · **SRI** — % of minutes in the same sleep/wake state 24 h apart\n*actigraphy-sleep-metrics*",
			"x": 425,
			"y": 90,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a-comp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Did they wear it?**\n**non-wear** ≥ 2 of 3 axis SD < 13 mg, ≥ 30 min\n**valid day** = ≥ 10 h wear **and** hourly-mean SVM range ≥ 20 (a real day/night swing)\n**PASS** ≥ 3 valid days",
			"x": 775,
			"y": 90,
			"width": 215,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "calib",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Calibration · step 3 — NOT WIRED IN**\na motionless device should read exactly 1 g; these read 10–15 mg out, which adds a pedestal to *every* epoch\n$SVM' = SVM - n|\\,\\|\\bar a\\|-1| + n|\\,\\|(\\bar a-o)s\\|-1|$  then − floor, clipped at 0\nper-position gain $b = M10_{ref}/M10_{pos}$\n*fixes L5 and RA; see the measure table in `pipeline.md`*",
			"x": 410,
			"y": 225,
			"width": 350,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "lane-mi",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "MiEYE  ·  light exposure at the eye",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 350,
			"width": 1010,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "m-src",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Light log**\nper-epoch spectral channels\n*`*-logged.csv`*",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 390,
			"width": 150,
			"height": 100
		},
		{
			"id": "m-tool",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Melanopic EDI**\nthe channel the body clock responds to (α-opic lux)\n*luminosity-metrics*",
			"x": 205,
			"y": 390,
			"width": 170,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "m-metrics",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**How much light, and when**\n**day / night mean MEDI** — in the 07–19 and 23–06 windows\n**TAT 250** — minutes at or above 250 lx in the day (Brown 2022 target)\n**TBT 10** — minutes below 10 lx at night\n**M5 / M7 / L2** — brightest 5 h / 7 h and darkest 2 h: onset hour + level\n**geometric mean** — mean of log₁₀, because light spans 5 orders of magnitude",
			"x": 425,
			"y": 390,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "m-comp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Was it worn, in daylight?**\ncharging ≠ wearing, so the rule is the *shape of the day*:\n**valid day** = day:night MEDI ratio ≥ 2 **and** ≥ 10 h above the light floor\n**PASS** ≥ 3 valid days",
			"x": 775,
			"y": 390,
			"width": 215,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "lane-xpw",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Expiwell  ·  experience sampling (ESM)",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 590,
			"width": 1010,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "x-src",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Survey responses**\none CSV per survey;\n**only completed ones are exported**",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 630,
			"width": 150,
			"height": 100
		},
		{
			"id": "x-tool",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Prompt schedule**\nthe denominator has to be *configured* — the file cannot tell you what was missed\n*expiwell-metrics*",
			"x": 205,
			"y": 630,
			"width": 170,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "x-metrics",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Mood, sleep and adherence**\n**response rate** = completed ÷ expected prompts\n**sleep diary** — TST = (lights-out → final wake) − SOL − WASO · SE = TST ÷ TIB\n**affect** — mean of the pleasant and unpleasant items (1–7), per response\n**day of study ≠ calendar day** — responses are placed on their real timestamp",
			"x": 425,
			"y": 630,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "x-comp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Did they answer enough?**\npooled response rate across scored surveys ≥ 70 %\n**PASS** · within 10 pts **REVIEW** · else **FAIL**",
			"x": 775,
			"y": 630,
			"width": 215,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "lane-todo",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Not implemented",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 830,
			"width": 1010,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "p-src",
