			"text": "**Saliva**\ncortisol / melatonin — ???",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 870,
			"width": 150,
			"height": 70
		},
		{
			"id": "p-batch",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Cognitron · Qualtrics** — exported **batched by upload date**, not per participant, so they need a collate step first (Cognitron also needs a `user_id` ↔ E-code crosswalk, which does not exist yet)",
			"x": 205,
