			"height": 70
		},
		{
			"id": "p-comp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "no verdict yet",
			"x": 775,
			"y": 870,
			"width": 215,
			"height": 70
		},
		{
			"id": "doc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Assessment log** · per participant-season\nwhat was *meant* to happen: visit number, device start dates, confirmed bed/wake times, and Day 1–15 ESM mapped to real dates\n*copied verbatim, not parsed*",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 990,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "out",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# 🗂️ Master\n`…\\CDxxx\\<Season>\\<Device>\\`\n\nper device — day-level metrics, report PDF, **`_compliance.json`** (the verdict every panel reads)\n\nper season — the assessment log\n\nper participant — roll-up `.csv/.xlsx`",
			"x": 1090,
			"y": 350,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 280,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "grp-dash",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "CD-Compliance-Checks  ·  one dashboard",
			"x": 1390,
			"y": -20,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 1120,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "d-run",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ① Compliance\n**⚑ naming check** before anything runs — a file whose name drifts is silently skipped or mis-attributed\n**RUN** · new / preview / force · **initials required**",
			"x": 1410,
			"y": 30,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "d-vis",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ② Visualise\nthe verdicts, read back: who passed, how many valid days, mean % compliance, by season and device",
			"x": 1410,
			"y": 330,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "d-t2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ③ T2 — reads only\n**Coverage** — the days each device recorded and the window where they overlap\n**Agreement** — two measures in the same unit; clock hours compared circularly: $\\Delta=((x-y+12)\\bmod 24)-12$\n**Relationships** — *within* a person (their own days, centred) vs *between* people (person means), FDR-corrected\n**Compare** — by season of the year, group, or person",
			"x": 1410,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "d-exp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ④ Export — the only write\nlists the files first, then takes the **approver's initials**",
			"x": 1410,
			"y": 740,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "runs",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 🧾 runs/\n**batches/** — public, stripped (who · when · counts · thresholds)\n**_private/** — participants + results, local only",
			"x": 1740,
			"y": 30,
			"width": 290,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "recompute",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Recompute** *(placeholder)*\nsome thresholds are baked **into** the numbers — light floor, non-wear rule, epoch length. Changing one means re-deriving the measures, not filtering them",
			"x": 1740,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 290,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
